(101224, 'Jinro ''Ilpoom'' Soju', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'South Korea', 'Rice + (Soju, etc.)', 23, 'Jinro ''Ilpoom'' Soju is a luxurious and premium soju that represents the pinnacle of soju craftsmanship. This high-end soju is carefully distilled and bottled, offering a refined and exceptionally smooth drinking experience.', FALSE, '2025-02-22', 'Soju', 0, 'https://88bamboo.co/blogs/everything-nice/taste-testing-jinro-sojus-new-jinro-gold-jinro-ilpoom', 'N/A', 'https://www.wine-searcher.com//images/labels/86/40/11168640.jpg'),
