(101083, 'Campari Cask Tales Rum Finish', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 25, 'Campari Cask Tales is a limited edition collection featuring the brand''s iconic bitter liqueur finished in unique barrels from across the globe. Here, Campari is finished in selected rum barrels from Appleton Estate Rum. With a finishing period of around 6 months, well-used casks were selected for the finishing to ensure the spirit would shine through. Campari Cask Tales is being sold as a 3-pack of 1L bottles set with this Rum Finish, a Tequila Finish, and a Bourbon Finish via ReserveBar.com. (SRP $495 for the 3-pack set). Campari Cask Tales is a limited edition collection featuring the brand''s iconic bitter liqueur finished in unique barrels from across the globe. Here, Campari is finished in selected rum barrels from Appleton Estate Rum. With a finishing period of around 6 months, well-used casks were selected for the finishing to ensure the spirit would shine through. Campari Cask Tales is being sold as a 3-pack of 1L bottles set with this Rum Finish, a Tequila Finish, and a Bourbon Finish via ReserveBar.com. (SRP $495 for the 3-pack set)', FALSE, '2025-02-13', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/22901690-bf25-013c-5a81-5ad3667651ec/campari_cask_tales_tequila_rum_bitter_original-1709866514.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100311, 'Campari Cask Tales Bourbon Finish', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 25, 'Campari Cask Tales is a limited edition collection featuring the brand''s iconic bitter liqueur finished in unique barrels from across the globe. Here, Campari is finished in selected bourbon barrels from Wild Turkey Bourbon. With a finishing period of around 6 months, well-used casks were selected for the finishing to ensure the spirit would shine through. Campari Cask Tales is being sold as a 3-pack of 1L bottles set with this Bourbon Finish, a Tequila Finish, and a Rum Finish via ReserveBar.com. (SRP $495 for the 3-pack set) . Campari Cask Tales is a limited edition collection featuring the brand''s iconic bitter liqueur finished in unique barrels from across the globe. Here, Campari is finished in selected bourbon barrels from Wild Turkey Bourbon. With a finishing period of around 6 months, well-used casks were selected for the finishing to ensure the spirit would shine through. Campari Cask Tales is being sold as a 3-pack of 1L bottles set with this Bourbon Finish, a Tequila Finish, and a Rum Finish via ReserveBar.com. (SRP $495 for the 3-pack set)', FALSE, '2025-02-25', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/f49b01b0-bf24-013c-c921-265d0c79fca1/campari-cask-tales-bourbon-finish_original-1709866428.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100695, 'Campari Cask Tales Tequila Finish', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 25, 'Campari Cask Tales is a limited edition collection featuring the brand''s iconic bitter liqueur finished in unique barrels from across the globe. Here, Campari is finished in selected tequila barrels from Espolòn Tequila. With a finishing period of around 6 months, well-used casks were selected for the finishing to ensure the spirit would shine through. Campari Cask Tales is being sold as a 3-pack of 1L bottles set with this Tequila Finish, a Rum Finish and a Bourbon Finish via ReserveBar.com. (SRP $495 for the 3-pack set) . Campari Cask Tales is a limited edition collection featuring the brand''s iconic bitter liqueur finished in unique barrels from across the globe. Here, Campari is finished in selected tequila barrels from Espolòn Tequila. With a finishing period of around 6 months, well-used casks were selected for the finishing to ensure the spirit would shine through. Campari Cask Tales is being sold as a 3-pack of 1L bottles set with this Tequila Finish, a Rum Finish and a Bourbon Finish via ReserveBar.com. (SRP $495 for the 3-pack set)', FALSE, '2025-01-03', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/cf5ef150-bf24-013c-96ea-0254d5b1cc65/campari_cask_tales_tequila_bitter_original-1709866360.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100281, 'Saint Brendan''s Irish Cream Espresso', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'Ireland', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 17, 'Saint Brendan''s Irish Cream Espresso is made with triple-distilled Irish whiskey, all-natural cream from Irish dairy farms and coffee flavor. Bottled at 34 proof, it''s available beginning February 2024. (SRP $14.99). Saint Brendan''s Irish Cream Espresso is made with triple-distilled Irish whiskey, all-natural cream from Irish dairy farms and coffee flavor. Bottled at 34 proof, it''s available beginning February 2024. (SRP $14.99)', FALSE, '2025-01-17', 'Coffee', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/7c239300-ae65-013c-4ad6-02eef0f1fc7e/saint-brendans-irish-cream-espresso_original-1708034097.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
