(100974, 'Chattanooga Whiskey Experimental Single Batch Series Batch 036: Herbal Infused', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40.5, 'This herbal-infused bourbon liqueur was inspired by German kräuterlikörs. Beginning with the brand''s signature Tennessee high-malt bourbon which contained a variety of German specialty malts, 14 different botanicals are infused — each one for different periods of time. Botanicals such as star anise, ginseng, bilberry, and sarsaparilla were used among others. After aging for a year in single-use bourbon barrels, dark candi syrup was blended in before bottling in a green-colored bottle. Available in January 2024 at the Experimental Distillery in Chattanooga, TN and online via Seelbach''s. (SRP $49. This herbal-infused bourbon liqueur was inspired by German kräuterlikörs. Beginning with the brand''s signature Tennessee high-malt bourbon which contained a variety of German specialty malts, 14 different botanicals are infused — each one for different periods of time. Botanicals such as star anise, ginseng, bilberry, and sarsaparilla were used among others. After aging for a year in single-use bourbon barrels, dark candi syrup was blended in before bottling in a green-colored bottle. Available in January 2024 at the Experimental Distillery in Chattanooga, TN and online via Seelbach''s. (SRP $49.99)', FALSE, '2025-01-18', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/3b2a6f30-987e-013c-93c4-3a01d95934cf/chattanooga_036_original-1705654218.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
