(100882, 'Cazadores Café', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Mexico', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 33, 'Cazadores Café is a tequila-based coffee liqueur. The brand begins with their Cazadores Blanco Tequila which is made with 100% agave. To that, a Mexican roasted coffee blend and agave nectar are added. Suggested serve as a shot, over ice, or in a Tequila Espresso Martini. Bottled at 33% ABV, it''s available nationwide as of July 2023. (SRP $29. Cazadores Café is a tequila-based coffee liqueur. The brand begins with their Cazadores Blanco Tequila which is made with 100% agave. To that, a Mexican roasted coffee blend and agave nectar are added. Suggested serve as a shot, over ice, or in a Tequila Espresso Martini. Bottled at 33% ABV, it''s available nationwide as of July 2023. (SRP $29.99)', FALSE, '2025-01-08', 'Coffee', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/50121620-017d-013c-2480-3640a7e8873c/cazadores-cafe%2525CC%252581_original-1689193985.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101308, 'Mozart White Chocolate Liqueur', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'Austria', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 15, 'Mozart Distillerie produces chocolate liqueurs in Salzburg, Austria — birthplace of composer Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart. This White Chocolate expression is a permanent part of the portfolio and is made with vanilla from Madagascar and cream from the Netherlands. It''s gluten free and bottled at 15% ABV. (SRP $29. Mozart Distillerie produces chocolate liqueurs in Salzburg, Austria — birthplace of composer Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart. This White Chocolate expression is a permanent part of the portfolio and is made with vanilla from Madagascar and cream from the Netherlands. It''s gluten free and bottled at 15% ABV. (SRP $29.99 per 750ml)', FALSE, '2025-01-23', 'Chocolate', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/a18dcd80-f9a7-013b-9cd1-4e959a66604c/mozard_white_chocolate_original-1688675827.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100501, 'Saint Brendan''s Salted Caramel', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Ireland', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 17, 'Produced in Northern Ireland by Niche Drinks, Saint Brendan''s Salted Caramel is made with triple-distilled Irish whiskey, all-natural cream from Irish dairy farms and salted caramel flavor. Bottled at 34 proof, it will be available as of late July 2023. (SRP $14.99). Produced in Northern Ireland by Niche Drinks, Saint Brendan''s Salted Caramel is made with triple-distilled Irish whiskey, all-natural cream from Irish dairy farms and salted caramel flavor. Bottled at 34 proof, it will be available as of late July 2023. (SRP $14.99)', FALSE, '2025-01-25', 'Cream', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/ed2c2f70-ed04-013b-2c0e-72239e3d5d5d/saint-brendans-salted-caramel_original-1686766093.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100420, 'Ezra Brooks Bourbon Cream', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 16.5, 'Ezra Brooks Bourbon Cream is made with all-natural cream and Kentucky straight bourbon whiskey. This is a reformulation that replaces the prior bottling that was offered at 25 proof. Here, the cream liqueur is bottled at 33 proof (16. 5% ABV) and has new packaging prominently displaying the proof. It''s available beginning May 2023 nationwide. (SRP $21. Ezra Brooks Bourbon Cream is made with all-natural cream and Kentucky straight bourbon whiskey. This is a reformulation that replaces the prior bottling that was offered at 25 proof. Here, the cream liqueur is bottled at 33 proof (16.5% ABV) and has new packaging prominently displaying the proof. It''s available beginning May 2023 nationwide. (SRP $21.99)', FALSE, '2025-01-21', 'Cream', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/0ad752a0-d575-013b-cdd0-02fd2c2794bd/ezra-brooks-bourbon-cream_original-1684444131.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101424, 'Freeland Spirits Cherry Blossom Liqueur', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 35, 'This Cherry Blossom Liqueur from Portland, Oregon-based Freeland Spirits is made with hand-harvested cherry blossoms from the Pacific Northwest. Also included are blooms from the Portland Japanese Garden. Bottled at 35% ABV, it''s available for purchase via the brand''s website beginning May 2023. (SRP $38). This Cherry Blossom Liqueur from Portland, Oregon-based Freeland Spirits is made with hand-harvested cherry blossoms from the Pacific Northwest. Also included are blooms from the Portland Japanese Garden. Bottled at 35% ABV, it''s available for purchase via the brand''s website beginning May 2023. (SRP $38)', FALSE, '2025-01-01', 'Floral', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/a3731e30-ccee-013b-c7c4-56c97231472a/freeland-spirits-cherry-blossom-liqueur_original-1683238809.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
