(100567, 'Baileys Vanilla Mint Shake', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Ireland', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 17, 'Baileys Vanilla Mint Shake is the brand''s first-ever minty green offering. The Irish Cream Liqueur is made with mint, vanilla and a hint of chocolate. It''s available nationwide for a limited time as of February 2023 just in time for your St. Patrick''s Day celebration. (SRP $24.99) . Baileys Vanilla Mint Shake is the brand''s first-ever minty green offering. The Irish Cream Liqueur is made with mint, vanilla and a hint of chocolate. It''s available nationwide for a limited time as of February 2023 just in time for your St. Patrick''s Day celebration. (SRP $24.99)', FALSE, '2025-01-03', 'Cream', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/8c62ddf0-856b-013b-f403-46295f62139b/baileys-vanilla-mint-shake_original-1675385471.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
