(101216, 'Luxardo Maraschino Perla Dry', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40, 'This is a limited edition release to celebrate the historic family owned and operated distillery''s bicentennial. It comes from a special reserve recipe of the iconic Luxardo Maraschino Liqueur, made from a marasca cherry distillate base that’s more than 50 years old. It is distilled to a higher proof than the original Maraschino recipe, also with reduced sugar content, intended to be enjoyed neat. It is bottled at 40% ABV, with 4,999 bottles available (only 1,000 for the US) as of September, 2021. This is a limited edition release to celebrate the historic family owned and operated distillery''s bicentennial. It comes from a special reserve recipe of the iconic Luxardo Maraschino Liqueur, made from a marasca cherry distillate base that’s more than 50 years old. It is distilled to a higher proof than the original Maraschino recipe, also with reduced sugar content, intended to be enjoyed neat. It is bottled at 40% ABV, with 4,999 bottles available (only 1,000 for the US) as of September, 2021.', FALSE, '2025-01-27', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/6b7dad20-0453-013a-8b8a-7260023e5e0a/luxardomara_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100621, 'Underberg', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Germany', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 44, 'This digestive liqueur is made from a secret recipe perfected by the company founded by Hubert Underberg that dates back to 1846 in Rheinberg, Germany. It is made with a robust mix of herbs that are sourced from 43 countries. It is bottled in 20 ml mini-bottles at 44% ABV. . This digestive liqueur is made from a secret recipe perfected by the company founded by Hubert Underberg that dates back to 1846 in Rheinberg, Germany. It is made with a robust mix of herbs that are sourced from 43 countries. It is bottled in 20 ml mini-bottles at 44% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-07', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/75a6abc0-f7bb-0139-e89b-62abc8211dbe/2ca9accd0301353d182fc11235f91b62_original.png?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark=https://s3.amazonaws.com/is.distiller.com/images/spirit_request_tags/liqueur_tag.png'),
(100819, 'Jim Beam Bourbon Cream', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 15, 'This cream liqueur from Jim Beam was released in December 2021. Made with Jim Beam Kentucky Straight Bourbon, this limited edition release is bottled at 15% ABV. This cream liqueur from Jim Beam was released in December 2021. Made with Jim Beam Kentucky Straight Bourbon, this limited edition release is bottled at 15% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-12', 'Cream', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/13f90900-e611-0139-ea6b-72564796e385/jimbeamvream_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101415, 'Baltamaro Chamomile Bitter', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'This is the 4th edition in Baltimore Spirits Company''s Baltamaro line, and the first new one since the initial 3 were introduced in 2017. Volume 4 is macerated with 18 different botanicals, including long pepper, chamomile, grapefruit, and gentian root, in the bitter aperitif style. It gets a rosy hue from carmine powder from cochineal insect shells. It is bottled at 60% ABV and available as of August, 2021. This is the 4th edition in Baltimore Spirits Company''s Baltamaro line, and the first new one since the initial 3 were introduced in 2017. Volume 4 is macerated with 18 different botanicals, including long pepper, chamomile, grapefruit, and gentian root, in the bitter aperitif style. It gets a rosy hue from carmine powder from cochineal insect shells. It is bottled at 60% ABV and available as of August, 2021.', FALSE, '2025-02-03', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/10d66990-ddcd-0139-6df8-6605c724f655/placeholder1_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
