(100470, 'Geijer California Falernum', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'Geijer California Falernum is made using a Jamaican style California-produced rum as a base, with lime peel, lime juice, ginger, almond, cloves, allspice, cardamom, bitter orange peel, cacao nibs, orange peel and cane sugar. Molasses is fermented using rum yeast and blended with the spices to create the final product. It is bottled at 30% ABV. . Geijer California Falernum is made using a Jamaican style California-produced rum as a base, with lime peel, lime juice, ginger, almond, cloves, allspice, cardamom, bitter orange peel, cacao nibs, orange peel and cane sugar. Molasses is fermented using rum yeast and blended with the spices to create the final product. It is bottled at 30% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-02-24', 'Other', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/9d5efd60-8918-0139-4422-4e1bbc11078a/geijer_california_falernum_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101179, 'Geijer California Amaro', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 38, 'Geijer California Amaro was created by the Swede turned Californian, Martin Geijer. While he does not share the full 31 botanical recipe behind his amaro, ingredients include Rhubarb root and Gentian root. Geijer California Amaro was created by the Swede turned Californian, Martin Geijer. While he does not share the full 31 botanical recipe behind his amaro, ingredients include Rhubarb root and Gentian root. It is bottled at 38% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-19', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/7edfea10-8918-0139-1c5d-6e35e3f8db74/geijer_california_amaro_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100027, 'Geijer California Fernet', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40, 'Geijer California Fernet is made using 21 different roots, herbs and spices. It starts with a neutral grain spirit base and uses ingredients such as Cinchona bark and Gentian root along with other bittering agents, though the brand does not disclose all ingredients. The botanicals in this fernet are macerated for months before resting in tanks prior to bottling. . Geijer California Fernet is made using 21 different roots, herbs and spices. It starts with a neutral grain spirit base and uses ingredients such as Cinchona bark and Gentian root along with other bittering agents, though the brand does not disclose all ingredients. The botanicals in this fernet are macerated for months before resting in tanks prior to bottling.', FALSE, '2025-02-14', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/5ee2ee30-8918-0139-1c5c-6e35e3f8db74/geijer_california_fernet_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100975, 'Geijer California Orange Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40, 'Geijer California Orange Liqueur is made using a neutral grain spirit with botanicals such as orange peel, bitter orange peel, vanilla beans, along with cane sugar. The botanicals are macerated over a single night and pot-distilled in small batches. It is bottled at 40% ABV. . Geijer California Orange Liqueur is made using a neutral grain spirit with botanicals such as orange peel, bitter orange peel, vanilla beans, along with cane sugar. The botanicals are macerated over a single night and pot-distilled in small batches. It is bottled at 40% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-24', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/2812bb80-8918-0139-1c5b-6e35e3f8db74/geijer_california_orange_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100565, 'Geijer California Glögg Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 20, 'Geijer California Glögg Liqueur was created by Martin Geijer, a Swedish transplant who now calls California home. Glögg is a traditional Swedish drink most often compared to English mulled wine, and is often served warm around the holidays. Geijer wanted to share his great grandmothers'' glögg recipe and it lead to the creation of this spiced liqueur. It is made using a neutral grain spirit base with botanicals such as cardamom, cinnamon, clove, raisin, almond and bitter orange peel. Geijer California Glögg Liqueur was created by Martin Geijer, a Swedish transplant who now calls California home. Glögg is a traditional Swedish drink most often compared to English mulled wine, and is often served warm around the holidays. Geijer wanted to share his great grandmothers'' glögg recipe and it lead to the creation of this spiced liqueur. It is made using a neutral grain spirit base with botanicals such as cardamom, cinnamon, clove, raisin, almond and bitter orange peel.', FALSE, '2025-02-20', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/ea9bb0e0-8917-0139-1c5a-6e35e3f8db74/geijer_california_glogg_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100338, 'Geijer California Spiced Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40, 'Geijer California Spiced Liqueur is made using a base of neutral grain spirit with botanicals such as cardamom, cinnamon, clove, ginger, raisin, almond, bitter orange peel, along with cane sugar. The botanicals are macerated for one night, then pot-distilled in small batches. It is bottled at 40% ABV. . Geijer California Spiced Liqueur is made using a base of neutral grain spirit with botanicals such as cardamom, cinnamon, clove, ginger, raisin, almond, bitter orange peel, along with cane sugar. The botanicals are macerated for one night, then pot-distilled in small batches. It is bottled at 40% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-25', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/9aa128c0-8917-0139-1c59-6e35e3f8db74/geijer_california_spiced_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
