(101325, 'Dolin Génépy le Chamois', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'France', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 45, 'Dolin Génépy le Chamois is an alpine herbal liqueur made predominantly with génépy, a petite variety of artemisia, also known as mountain sage. Dolin has been making it since 1821 in an alembic still using local farmers'' herbs. Dolin Génépy le Chamois is an alpine herbal liqueur made predominantly with génépy, a petite variety of artemisia, also known as mountain sage.  Dolin has been making it since 1821 in an alembic still using local farmers'' herbs.', FALSE, '2025-01-31', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/dfa927f0-3e83-0139-4454-029b7b253720/dolin_genepy_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
