(101055, 'RumChata Peppermint Bark', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 14, 'Following its successful original flavor, the RumChata brand added Peppermint Bark to its portfolio this year. The new addition also contains Caribbean rum and dairy cream from Wisconsin like the original version . Following its successful original flavor, the RumChata brand added Peppermint Bark to its portfolio this year. The new addition also contains Caribbean rum and dairy cream from Wisconsin like the original version', FALSE, '2025-01-01', 'Cream', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/c1e34810-215e-0139-2f5c-7a15e0b44ca5/rum_chata_peppermint_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
