(101430, 'Rising Sun Colorado Chile Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'Denver-based Rising Sun Distillery makes certified organic spirits sourcing their ingredients from local organic farmers within 300 miles of the distillery. Their Organic Colorado Chile Liqueur begins with the distillery''s Chile Spirit as the base. Organic agave syrup and dried Hatch chiles are added before bottling at 60 proof. . Denver-based Rising Sun Distillery makes certified organic spirits sourcing their ingredients from local organic farmers within 300 miles of the distillery. Their Organic Colorado Chile Liqueur begins with the distillery''s Chile Spirit as the base. Organic agave syrup and dried Hatch chiles are added before bottling at 60 proof.', FALSE, '2025-02-08', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/f71fb9f0-8f1b-0138-061a-12f0c8b4c250/rising_sun_colorado_chile_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100897, 'Rising Sun Lavender Hibiscus Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'Denver-based Rising Sun Distillery makes certified organic spirits sourcing their ingredients from local organic farmers within 300 miles of the distillery. Their Lavender Hibiscus Liqueur is made by not only adding lavender and hibiscus flowers to neutral spirit before re-distilling, but they are also used to infuse the spirit post-distillation to add color. Honey is used as the sweetener. Bottled at 60 proof. Denver-based Rising Sun Distillery makes certified organic spirits sourcing their ingredients from local organic farmers within 300 miles of the distillery. Their Lavender Hibiscus Liqueur is made by not only adding lavender and hibiscus flowers to neutral spirit before re-distilling, but they are also used to infuse the spirit post-distillation to add color. Honey is used as the sweetener. Bottled at 60 proof.', FALSE, '2025-01-22', 'Floral', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/58bca210-8f1b-0138-964c-16c1d6802bb3/lavender_hibiscus_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
