(101114, 'Alizé Gold Passion', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'France', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 16, 'Alizé Gold Passion is a French liqueur made by blending cognac and passion fruit. It is then infused with additional fruit juices. Alizé means trade wind in French. . Alizé Gold Passion is a French liqueur made by blending cognac and passion fruit. It is then infused with additional fruit juices. Alizé means trade wind in French.', FALSE, '2025-01-21', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/50ade5e0-cda2-0137-ff02-52de66afb543/alize_gold_passion_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
