(101274, 'Jack Daniel''s Tennessee Apple', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 35, 'Released in October 2019, Jack Daniel''s Tennessee Apple is made by adding apple liqueur to Jack Daniel''s Tennessee Whiskey. It is bottled at 70 proof and is sold in a variety of sizes. Released in October 2019, Jack Daniel''s Tennessee Apple is made by adding apple liqueur to Jack Daniel''s Tennessee Whiskey. It is bottled at 70 proof and is sold in a variety of sizes.', FALSE, '2025-02-16', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/ff61a910-c83a-0137-f24d-42c93c60d08e/jack_daniels_tennessee_apple_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101154, 'Varnelli Caffè Moka', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'Caffè Moka is made by the Varnelli family which has been making spirits in Le Marche since 1868. Their coffee liqueur, Caffé Moka, is made using real Italian espresso, grain alcohol, and honey. No artificial flavors are used. Bottled at 30% ABV. Caffè Moka is made by the Varnelli family which has been making spirits in Le Marche since 1868. Their coffee liqueur, Caffé Moka, is made using real Italian espresso, grain alcohol, and honey. No artificial flavors are used. Bottled at 30% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-27', 'Coffee', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/31e09b00-c1ef-0137-538d-564072204aac/varnelli_caffe_moka_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101302, 'Heering Coffee Liqueur', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'Denmark', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 35, 'Heering Coffee Liqueur is made with Caribbean rum, cocoa, and coffee. It is bottled without any artificial flavors or colors added at 70 proof. Heering Coffee Liqueur is made with Caribbean rum, cocoa, and coffee. It is bottled without any artificial flavors or colors added at 70 proof.', FALSE, '2025-01-06', 'Coffee', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/f788e6e0-c1ea-0137-e6eb-16db1077e34c/heering_coffee_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100585, 'St. George NOLA Coffee Liqueur', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 25, 'St. George distiller Dave Smith was inspired by New Orleans chicory-style coffee when he crafted St. George NOLA Coffee Liqueur. It is made with Ethiopian Yirgacheffe coffee beans which are roasted on an early 1950s Probat roaster. The beans are grinded on the distillery''s own grain mill and then brewed using the cold-infusion method. French-roasted chicory root, Madagascar vanilla, and organic cane sugar are also used in the coffee liqueur. St. George distiller Dave Smith was inspired by New Orleans chicory-style coffee when he crafted St. George NOLA Coffee Liqueur. It is made with Ethiopian Yirgacheffe coffee beans which are roasted on an early 1950s Probat roaster. The beans are grinded on the distillery''s own grain mill and then brewed using the cold-infusion method. French-roasted chicory root, Madagascar vanilla, and organic cane sugar are also used in the coffee liqueur.', FALSE, '2025-01-30', 'Coffee', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/c7147a90-c1e8-0137-e6ea-16db1077e34c/st_george_nola_coffee_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
