(101007, 'Southern Comfort 100 Proof', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 50, 'Introduced by the Sazerac Company in 2017, Southern Comfort 100 Proof is made with a mix of Northern American whiskeys owned by the company. Like the Original, it is flavored with fruits and spices. Introduced by the Sazerac Company in 2017, Southern Comfort 100 Proof is made with a mix of Northern American whiskeys owned by the company. Like the Original, it is flavored with fruits and spices.', FALSE, '2025-01-15', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/5d255820-518d-0137-6758-1aeffe40e5ed/southern-comfort-100-proof_original-1699305096.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
