(101530, 'St. George Raspberry Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 20, 'St. George makes their own Raspberry Brandy so their Raspberry Liqueur uses that eau-de-vie as its base here. Then organic cane sugar and fresh raspberry juice is added giving the liqueur its jewel color. Bottled at 40 proof. St. George makes their own Raspberry Brandy so their Raspberry Liqueur uses that eau-de-vie as its base here. Then organic cane sugar and fresh raspberry juice is added giving the liqueur its jewel color. Bottled at 40 proof.', FALSE, '2025-01-31', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/14065880-4c1d-0137-f79c-0e1dac9bf990/st-george-raspberry-liqueur_original-1666654179.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
