(100962, 'Granada-Vallet', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Mexico', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 32, 'Granada-Vallet is a bitter pomegranate liqueur made by the Mexican spirits company, Royal Vallet. In addition to pomegranate, ingredients such as cinnamon, fennel, gentian root, wormwood and cinchona root are included. Oaxacan cochineal (insects) are used in its production to give the bitter liqueur its red color. . Granada-Vallet is a bitter pomegranate liqueur made by the Mexican spirits company, Royal Vallet. In addition to pomegranate, ingredients such as cinnamon, fennel, gentian root, wormwood and cinchona root are included. Oaxacan cochineal (insects) are used in its production to give the bitter liqueur its red color.', FALSE, '2025-02-07', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/92fc0500-4842-0137-c323-6e82796b621c/granada_vallet_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
