(100377, 'Breckenridge Bitter', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 36, 'Breckenridge Bitter is made at the Breckenridge Distillery in Colorado. True to its roots, this bitter aperitif is made with Alpine herbs and roots along with dried fruits. Breckenridge Bitter is made at the Breckenridge Distillery in Colorado. True to its roots, this bitter aperitif is made with Alpine herbs and roots along with dried fruits. Bottled at 72 proof.', FALSE, '2025-02-25', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/5f251250-42c2-0137-3258-1643e819bb09/breckenridge_bittle_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101423, 'Luxardo Amaretto', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 28, 'Luxardo Amaretto gets its almond flavor from the essential oils found in the pits of cherries, peaches, and apricots which are used in its production. This amaretto is GMO free, Kosher certified, and vegan friendly. Luxardo Amaretto gets its almond flavor from the essential oils found in the pits of cherries, peaches, and apricots which are used in its production. This amaretto is GMO free, Kosher certified, and vegan friendly.', FALSE, '2025-01-03', 'Nut', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/22ab32d0-35eb-0137-0bdb-4e6d7433670f/luxardo_amaretto_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100645, 'Townshend''s Pacific Northwest Fernet', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40, 'Townshend''s Distillery based in Portland, Oregon makes its spirits using kombucha, a fermented tea, as the base. Their Pacific Northwest Fernet highlights the area''s botanicals such as Douglas Fir, Willamette hops, and birch bark. Townshend''s Distillery based in Portland, Oregon makes its spirits using kombucha, a fermented tea, as the base. Their Pacific Northwest Fernet highlights the area''s botanicals such as Douglas Fir, Willamette hops, and birch bark. Bottled at 80 proof.', FALSE, '2025-01-23', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/5f8320c0-30e8-0137-9655-7e8e3222ecfe/townshend_fernet_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100305, 'Fernet Francisco Manzanilla', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 40, 'Fernet Francisco Manzanilla was first introduced to the market in 2015 by San Francisco-based fernet enthusiasts, Max Rudsten and Ben Flajnik. It is made with a variety of herbs and botanicals sourced from local Bay Area markets including rhubarb, gentian root, cardamom, bay leaves, orange peels, and peppermint among others. The featured ingredient is German chamomile which is also called manzanilla. . Fernet Francisco Manzanilla was first introduced to the market in 2015 by San Francisco-based fernet enthusiasts, Max Rudsten and Ben Flajnik. It is made with a variety of herbs and botanicals sourced from local Bay Area markets including rhubarb, gentian root, cardamom, bay leaves, orange peels, and peppermint among others. The featured ingredient is German chamomile which is also called manzanilla.', FALSE, '2025-01-27', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/045ef0e0-30e5-0137-6cab-0260d17cb55c/fernet_manzanilla_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101367, 'Letherbee Fernet', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 35, 'This fernet is made by Chicago-based Letherbee Distillers. It is made with a variety of botanicals and bittering agents such as saffron, spearmint, eucalyptus, rhubarb root, fennel, wormwood, and gentian among others. This fernet is made by Chicago-based Letherbee Distillers. It is made with a variety of botanicals and bittering agents such as saffron, spearmint, eucalyptus, rhubarb root, fennel, wormwood, and gentian among others.', FALSE, '2025-02-13', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/d67c8e10-30e0-0137-9650-7e8e3222ecfe/letherbee_fernet_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100127, 'Dekuyper Triple Sec', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 0, 'This citrus liqueur is distilled from the dried peels of both sweet and bitter oranges. . This citrus liqueur is distilled from the dried peels of both sweet and bitter oranges.', FALSE, '2025-01-15', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/12d2c3c0-3090-0137-9754-7e3cd949854a/dekuyper-triple-sec_original-1694818977.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100951, 'Leopold Bros. Aperitivo', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 24, 'Leopold Bros. Aperitivo is an alternative to the more well known brand in this category: Campari. First introduced in 2015, ingredients such as gentian root, coriander, grapefruit peels, hyssop, and artemisia pontica are used. It is sweetened with cane sugar. In addition, natural cochineal, sourced ethically from South America is added to give the bitter liqueur the classic orange-red color. . Leopold Bros. Aperitivo is an alternative to the more well known brand in this category: Campari. First introduced in 2015, ingredients such as gentian root, coriander, grapefruit peels, hyssop, and artemisia pontica are used. It is sweetened with cane sugar. In addition, natural cochineal, sourced ethically from South America is added to give the bitter liqueur the classic orange-red color.', FALSE, '2025-01-23', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/cf11e810-2d98-0137-7941-3e14269e1e68/leopold_aperitivo_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101002, 'The Dubliner Whiskey & Honeycomb Liqueur', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'Ireland', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'The Dubliner Whiskey & Honeycomb Liqueur is made by master distiller John Drennan. It is a blend of Irish whiskey, honeycomb, and caramel flavors. Bottled at 60 proof. . The Dubliner Whiskey & Honeycomb Liqueur is made by master distiller John Drennan. It is a blend of Irish whiskey, honeycomb, and caramel flavors. Bottled at 60 proof.', FALSE, '2025-02-15', 'Other', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/be53ad60-2cdd-0137-15d8-4664ce4efb6f/the-dubliner-whiskey-honeycomb-liqueur-update_original-1679088969.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100835, 'Prucia Plum Liqueur', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'France', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 15, 'Prucia Plum Liqueur is made using Japanese ume plums which are grown in France. These plums macerate in grape spirit for a time and then the spirit is aged in ex-cognac casks. Prucia Plum Liqueur is made using Japanese ume plums which are grown in France. These plums macerate in grape spirit for a time and then the spirit is aged in ex-cognac casks.', FALSE, '2025-02-08', 'Fruit', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/3926db30-21e6-0137-e0f6-46de7d8098d2/prucia_plum_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101094, 'Amer Picon', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'France', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 21, 'Amer Picon is an aperitif liqueur made with fresh and dried orange peels along with dried gentian roots and quinine. Amer in French means "bitter. " Not currently available in the US.  . Amer Picon is an aperitif liqueur made with fresh and dried orange peels along with dried gentian roots and quinine. Amer in French means "bitter." Not currently available in the US.', FALSE, '2025-02-22', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/bddd6310-21e2-0137-0797-6e64a05e08eb/amer_picon_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101088, 'Amaro Bràulio Riserva Special', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 25, 'Amaro Bràulio Riserva Special is a limited annual edition released by the brand. It differs slightly from the standard bottling as it is aged in slightly smaller barrels than its predecessor. Also this release is less filtered and bottled at a slightly higher proof. Each bottle is numbered and states the year of release. Amaro Bràulio Riserva Special is a limited annual edition released by the brand. It differs slightly from the standard bottling as it is aged in slightly smaller barrels than its predecessor. Also this release is less filtered and bottled at a slightly higher proof. Each bottle is numbered and states the year of release.', FALSE, '2025-02-03', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/febe3470-21e7-0137-c0ab-22a6f0e9afd4/amaro_braulio_riserva_speciale_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(100201, 'Contratto Aperitif', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 13.5, 'Contratto Aperitif is made using a recipe which dates back to 1935. The brand uses 28 herbs, spices, roots and seeds which are infused and blended into Italian grappa. These include aloe, angelica, wormwood, safflower, cinchona, bitter orange, sweet orange, lemon, mandarin, hawthorn, cloves, cardamom, licorice, juniper, mint, rhubarb, sage, nettle and ginger. It is naturally colored using carrot and beetroot extract and is bottled at 13. Contratto Aperitif is made using a recipe which dates back to 1935. The brand uses 28 herbs, spices, roots and seeds which are infused and blended into Italian grappa. These include aloe, angelica, wormwood, safflower, cinchona, bitter orange, sweet orange, lemon, mandarin, hawthorn, cloves, cardamom, licorice, juniper, mint, rhubarb, sage, nettle and ginger. It is naturally colored using carrot and beetroot extract and is bottled at 13.5% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-07', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/a29d3340-1ec9-0137-8755-0ae88ba32b17/contratto_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark=https://s3.amazonaws.com/is.distiller.com/images/spirit_request_tags/liqueur_tag.png'),
(100963, 'Contratto Bitter Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Italy', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 22, 'Contratto Bitter Liqueur is made using 24 herbs, spices, roots, and seeds such as aloe, bitter and sweet orange peels, cardamom, cloves, gentian root, ginger, hibiscus, mint, rhubarb, sage, and wormwood among others. These botanicals are cold-infused in Italian brandy. The color is 100% natural from vegetable extracts (carrots and beets). . Contratto Bitter Liqueur is made using 24 herbs, spices, roots, and seeds such as aloe, bitter and sweet orange peels, cardamom, cloves, gentian root, ginger, hibiscus, mint, rhubarb, sage, and wormwood among others. These botanicals are cold-infused in Italian brandy. The color is 100% natural from vegetable extracts (carrots and beets).', FALSE, '2025-02-16', 'Herbs & Spices', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/7d02bd30-1ec8-0137-11d2-0ea39cd413ca/contratto_bitter_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101459, 'Sheridan''s Coffee Layered Liqueur', 1, 'Original Bottling', 'Ireland', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 15.5, 'This expression was created for the European and UK duty free market. It is a special bottling split between coffee and vanilla Irish cream liqueurs. It is bottled at 15.5% ABV. This expression was created for the European and UK duty free market. It is a special bottling split between coffee and vanilla Irish cream liqueurs. It is bottled at 15.5% ABV.', FALSE, '2025-01-06', 'Coffee', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/bb905430-1f57-0137-2a0c-52ac8b9a6b35/sheridans-coffee-layered-liqueur_original-1693352204.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101301, 'Patrón XO Cafe Dark Cocoa', 21, 'Original Bottling', 'Mexico', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 30, 'Introduced in February 2012, Patrón XO Cafe Dark Cocoa is a coffee & chocolate liqueur. It''s made with Patrón Silver tequila, coffee from Veracruz and Chiapas, and Criollo chocolate from Tabasco. Bottled at 60 proof. . Introduced in February 2012, Patrón XO Cafe Dark Cocoa is a coffee & chocolate liqueur. It''s made with Patrón Silver tequila, coffee from Veracruz and Chiapas, and Criollo chocolate from Tabasco. Bottled at 60 proof.', FALSE, '2025-01-18', 'Chocolate', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/5f7ec960-1c5d-0137-67a5-1e32c900bc5d/patro%2525CC%252581n-xo-cafe-dark-cocoa_original-1667869921.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
(101467, 'Fruitlab Hibiscus Liqueur', 22, 'Original Bottling', 'United States', 'Liqueurs & Bitters', 20, 'Fruitlab Hibiscus Liqueur is made by Greenbar Distillery in downtown Los Angeles and was inspired by Mexican agua frescas. Made using a molasses-based spirit as the base, whole hibiscus flowers are used along with lemons, geranium, tea, jasmine, tamarind, and cane sugar. Fruitlab Hibiscus Liqueur is made by Greenbar Distillery in downtown Los Angeles and was inspired by Mexican agua frescas. Made using a molasses-based spirit as the base, whole hibiscus flowers are used along with lemons, geranium, tea, jasmine, tamarind, and cane sugar.', FALSE, '2025-02-03', 'Floral', 0, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'https://ip-distiller.imgix.net/images/spirits/d5dde540-1c4a-0137-6792-1e32c900bc5d/greenbar_fruitlab_hibiscus_liqueur_original.jpg?w=280&h=280&mark-w=70&mark-h=70&fit=crop&crop=right&mark-align=top,left&mark-pad=0&mark='),
